Alembic migrations for Memoria.

From the `backend/` directory (venv activated):

  alembic upgrade head          # apply all pending migrations
  alembic current               # show current DB revision
  alembic history               # list all revisions
  alembic downgrade -1          # roll back one revision
  alembic revision -m "desc"    # create a new revision

All migrations are idempotent (IF NOT EXISTS / ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS),
so `upgrade head` is safe to run against a pre-existing schema.
